### Health
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/health

### List Samsung phones
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/phones?limit=20

### Full phone record
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/phones/samsung-galaxy-s23

### Compare S23 and S22
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/phones/compare?slugs=samsung-galaxy-s23,samsung-galaxy-s22

### Battery capacity ranking
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/phones/best-battery

### Chat: camera specs
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": "What are the camera specifications of the Samsung Galaxy S23?"
}

### Chat: best battery capacity
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": "Which Samsung phone has the best battery life?"
}

### Review agent
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/reviews/samsung-galaxy-s23
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "include_limitations": true
}

### Add a dated price observation (use a real source before doing this)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/phones/samsung-galaxy-s23/prices
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount": 85000,
  "currency": "BDT",
  "source": "Retailer name / product URL"
}

### Scrape two models
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/scraper/run
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "models": ["Galaxy S23", "Galaxy S24 Ultra"],
  "delay_seconds": 2
}
